{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"CVIS — Connected Vehicle Intelligence System","description":"Backend for the CVIS academic project. Receives telemetry from ESP32 vehicle nodes via HTTP or MQTT, enforces HMAC-SHA256 / AES-GCM integrity, persists to SQLite, runs Ollama AI analysis, and fans out to frontend via WebSocket.","version":"2.0.0"},"paths":{"/api/v1/telemetry":{"post":{"tags":["telemetry"],"summary":"Ingest a telemetry packet from a vehicle node (HTTP)","description":"Receive a telemetry packet via HTTP.\n\n**Headers (when auth is enabled):**\n- `X-API-Key`: device API key issued at registration\n- `X-HMAC-Signature`: HMAC-SHA256 hex of the *plaintext* JSON body\n- `X-Encrypted: true` (optional): signals the body is an AES-GCM envelope\n\n**Body (plaintext mode):**\n```json\n{\"device_id\": \"...\", \"schema_version\": \"1.0\", \"mode\": \"Healthy\", ...}\n```\n\n**Body (encrypted mode, when X-Encrypted: true):**\n```json\n{\"iv\": \"<12-byte hex>\", \"ct\": \"<ciphertext hex>\", \"tag\": \"<16-byte hex>\"}\n```","operationId":"ingest_telemetry_api_v1_telemetry_post","parameters":[{"name":"x-api-key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Api-Key"}},{"name":"x-hmac-signature","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Hmac-Signature"}},{"name":"x-encrypted","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Encrypted"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Ingest Telemetry Api V1 Telemetry Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/telemetry/recent":{"get":{"tags":["telemetry"],"summary":"Fetch the N most recent telemetry rows","description":"Return the most recent telemetry records for WS backfill on connect.","operationId":"get_recent_telemetry_api_v1_telemetry_recent_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":10,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"device_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Device Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"title":"Response Get Recent Telemetry Api V1 Telemetry Recent Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/telemetry/packets":{"get":{"tags":["telemetry"],"summary":"Fetch raw packet log (for NOC packet table)","description":"Return the most recent raw packet log entries for the NOC packet table.","operationId":"get_packets_api_v1_telemetry_packets_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"device_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Device Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"title":"Response Get Packets Api V1 Telemetry Packets Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/devices/register":{"post":{"tags":["devices"],"summary":"Register a new ESP32 vehicle node","description":"Issue credentials for a new vehicle node.\n\n- **api_key** — include in `X-API-Key` header on every HTTP request,\n  or in the `_meta.api_key` field of MQTT payloads.\n- **device_secret** — used to sign payloads with HMAC-SHA256,\n  and as the AES-256-GCM key when encryption is enabled.\n\n> **Important:** The `api_key` is shown exactly once. Store it immediately\n> in `firmware/secrets.h`. It cannot be recovered — only reset by\n> re-registering the device.","operationId":"register_device_api_v1_devices_register_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegisterRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegisterResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/devices":{"get":{"tags":["devices","devices"],"summary":"List all registered devices","description":"Return all registered devices (without secrets).","operationId":"list_devices_api_v1_devices_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"items":{"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Response List Devices Api V1 Devices Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/protocol":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get current active protocol","operationId":"get_protocol_api_v1_config_protocol_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Protocol Api V1 Config Protocol Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Switch active protocol (HTTP ↔ MQTT)","description":"Switch the active protocol at runtime. The backend broadcasts the new\nprotocol to all MQTT subscribers so ESP32 nodes self-switch without restart.","operationId":"set_protocol_api_v1_config_protocol_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProtocolConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Protocol Api V1 Config Protocol Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/encryption":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get current encryption state","operationId":"get_encryption_api_v1_config_encryption_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Encryption Api V1 Config Encryption Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Toggle AES-GCM encryption","description":"Enable or disable AES-256-GCM payload encryption.\nWhen enabled, ESP32 encrypts the JSON body before sending.\nBackend decrypts and verifies the GCM authentication tag.","operationId":"set_encryption_api_v1_config_encryption_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EncryptionConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Encryption Api V1 Config Encryption Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/auth":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get current auth enforcement state","operationId":"get_auth_api_v1_config_auth_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Auth Api V1 Config Auth Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Toggle auth enforcement (demo: show open vs secured)","description":"Enable or disable authentication enforcement.\nWhen disabled, the backend accepts unauthenticated packets and logs them\nas 'no_auth' events — useful for demonstrating open vs. secured traffic.","operationId":"set_auth_api_v1_config_auth_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Auth Api V1 Config Auth Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/chaos":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get current chaos settings","operationId":"get_chaos_api_v1_config_chaos_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Chaos Api V1 Config Chaos Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Update chaos/simulation settings","description":"Configure the chaos middleware:\n- **loss_pct**: probabilistically drops packets before processing\n- **latency_ms**: adds artificial delay before processing\n- **tamper**: mutates a payload field post-signature to trigger HMAC rejection","operationId":"set_chaos_api_v1_config_chaos_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChaosConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Chaos Api V1 Config Chaos Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/replay":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get replay protection state","operationId":"get_replay_api_v1_config_replay_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Replay Api V1 Config Replay Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Enable/disable replay protection","description":"Enable or disable timestamp-window replay protection.\nWhen enabled, the same (device_id, timestamp_ms) pair cannot be\naccepted twice within the configured window.","operationId":"set_replay_api_v1_config_replay_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ReplayConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Replay Api V1 Config Replay Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/all":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get all runtime configuration in one call","description":"Snapshot of all current backend config — useful for NOC on connect.","operationId":"get_all_config_api_v1_config_all_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get All Config Api V1 Config All Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/mode":{"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Force a specific vehicle mode","operationId":"set_force_mode_api_v1_config_mode_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ModeConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Force Mode Api V1 Config Mode Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/mobile-access":{"get":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Get mobile app access state for a vehicle","description":"Return the mobile app access state and tier for the given vehicle.\nAccess is granted only if the global mobile_app_enabled is true AND vehicle is premium.","operationId":"get_mobile_access_api_v1_config_mobile_access_get","parameters":[{"name":"vehicle_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vehicle Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Mobile Access Api V1 Config Mobile Access Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/config/mobile-app":{"post":{"tags":["config"],"summary":"Globally enable or disable mobile app access","description":"NOC-controlled gate: globally enable or disable the mobile app URL.\nEven if globally enabled, only premium-tier vehicles can access it (enforced by GET endpoint).","operationId":"set_global_mobile_app_api_v1_config_mobile_app_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GlobalMobileAppConfig"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Global Mobile App Api V1 Config Mobile App Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/ai/recommendation":{"post":{"tags":["ai"],"summary":"Generate AI recommendation for latest telemetry","description":"Fetch the most recent telemetry for the specified device and generate\nan AI recommendation based on the full multi-factor snapshot.\n\nNow includes:\n  - Trend context from the last 5 readings (②)\n  - Mode-transition detection (④)\n  - Structured severity field in response (③)","operationId":"get_recommendation_api_v1_ai_recommendation_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RecommendationRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Recommendation Api V1 Ai Recommendation Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/ai/chat":{"post":{"tags":["ai"],"summary":"Chat with CVIS AI grounded in current telemetry","description":"Free-text driver chat grounded in current + recent telemetry.\nThe model is explicitly prohibited from inventing vehicle state —\nit must base responses on the actual telemetry provided in the prompt.\n\nNow uses system/user message split (①) and richer trend context (②).","operationId":"driver_chat_api_v1_ai_chat_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChatRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Driver Chat Api V1 Ai Chat Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/ai/status":{"get":{"tags":["ai"],"summary":"Check Ollama availability and model status","description":"Used by admin panel to show AI service health.","operationId":"ai_status_api_v1_ai_status_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Ai Status Api V1 Ai Status Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/stats":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Overall server + system stats","description":"Comprehensive server stats for the admin dashboard.","operationId":"get_stats_api_v1_admin_stats_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Stats Api V1 Admin Stats Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/auth-logs":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Auth and tamper event log","description":"Return auth log entries, newest first.","operationId":"get_auth_logs_api_v1_admin_auth_logs_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":500,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"event_type","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter: auth_ok|auth_fail|tamper_detected|registered|no_auth","title":"Event Type"},"description":"Filter: auth_ok|auth_fail|tamper_detected|registered|no_auth"},{"name":"device_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by device ID","title":"Device Id"},"description":"Filter by device ID"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"title":"Response Get Auth Logs Api V1 Admin Auth Logs Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/packet-stats":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Packet statistics over time","description":"Return packet counts grouped by hour for the last N hours.","operationId":"get_packet_stats_api_v1_admin_packet_stats_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":168,"minimum":1,"default":24,"title":"Hours"}},{"name":"device_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Filter by device ID","title":"Device Id"},"description":"Filter by device ID"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Packet Stats Api V1 Admin Packet Stats Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/devices":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Connected device status","description":"Return all registered devices with their last-seen telemetry.","operationId":"get_devices_api_v1_admin_devices_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"items":{"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Response Get Devices Api V1 Admin Devices Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/deactivate-device":{"post":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Deactivate a device (admin only — for re-registration)","description":"Deactivate a device so it can be re-registered.\nUsed by test scripts to reset state without dropping the DB.","operationId":"admin_deactivate_device_api_v1_admin_deactivate_device_post","parameters":[{"name":"device_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Admin Deactivate Device Api V1 Admin Deactivate Device Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/admin/error-log":{"get":{"tags":["admin"],"summary":"Failed packets and error events","description":"Return packets with non-ok status.","operationId":"get_error_log_api_v1_admin_error_log_get","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":500,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"},"title":"Response Get Error Log Api V1 Admin Error Log Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/control/disconnect":{"post":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Disconnect (deactivate) a vehicle node","description":"Deactivate a vehicle node so its next packet is rejected with 401.\n\nFor HTTP: the device's active flag is set to 0 — auth will fail on\nnext request. For MQTT: a 'disconnect' command is published to\ncvis/control/{device_id} so the firmware can acknowledge and halt.","operationId":"disconnect_vehicle_api_v1_control_disconnect_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DisconnectRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Disconnect Vehicle Api V1 Control Disconnect Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/control/reconnect":{"post":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Re-activate a previously disconnected vehicle node","description":"Re-activate a deactivated device (does not issue new credentials).","operationId":"reconnect_vehicle_api_v1_control_reconnect_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DisconnectRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Reconnect Vehicle Api V1 Control Reconnect Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/control/ai-service":{"get":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Get AI service status","operationId":"get_ai_service_status_api_v1_control_ai_service_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Get Ai Service Status Api V1 Control Ai Service Get"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Stop or start the AI recommendation service","description":"Stop or start the AI recommendation layer.\n\nWhen stopped: telemetry still flows, is stored, and is broadcast via\nWebSocket — but the Ollama inference call is skipped. This simulates\nAI service failure while the secure communication layer stays healthy.","operationId":"set_ai_service_api_v1_control_ai_service_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AiServiceRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Ai Service Api V1 Control Ai Service Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/control/vehicles":{"get":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Get the canonical fleet of 4 vehicles","description":"Return the static fleet definition enriched with live device status from DB.","operationId":"get_vehicles_api_v1_control_vehicles_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"items":{"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Response Get Vehicles Api V1 Control Vehicles Get"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/control/ai-service/vehicle":{"post":{"tags":["control"],"summary":"Enable or disable AI for a specific vehicle","description":"Override AI service state for a specific vehicle without affecting others.","operationId":"set_vehicle_ai_service_api_v1_control_ai_service_vehicle_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VehicleAiRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Set Vehicle Ai Service Api V1 Control Ai Service Vehicle Post"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"tags":["system"],"summary":"Health","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","title":"Response Health Health Get"}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"AiServiceRequest":{"properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled","description":"True = AI running, False = stopped"}},"type":"object","required":["enabled"],"title":"AiServiceRequest"},"AuthConfig":{"properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled"}},"type":"object","required":["enabled"],"title":"AuthConfig"},"ChaosConfig":{"properties":{"loss_pct":{"type":"integer","title":"Loss Pct","description":"Packet loss % (0/5/10/25)","default":0},"latency_ms":{"type":"integer","title":"Latency Ms","description":"Artificial latency ms (0/100/300/1000)","default":0},"tamper":{"type":"boolean","title":"Tamper","description":"Enable packet tampering injector","default":false}},"type":"object","title":"ChaosConfig"},"ChatRequest":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id","description":"Vehicle node context"},"message":{"type":"string","maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"title":"Message","description":"Driver's question or message"}},"type":"object","required":["device_id","message"],"title":"ChatRequest"},"DisconnectRequest":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id","description":"Device to disconnect"},"reason":{"type":"string","title":"Reason","description":"Reason for disconnect","default":"NOC disconnect"}},"type":"object","required":["device_id"],"title":"DisconnectRequest"},"EncryptionConfig":{"properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled"}},"type":"object","required":["enabled"],"title":"EncryptionConfig"},"GlobalMobileAppConfig":{"properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled","description":"True = global mobile app access granted"}},"type":"object","required":["enabled"],"title":"GlobalMobileAppConfig"},"HTTPValidationError":{"properties":{"detail":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ValidationError"},"type":"array","title":"Detail"}},"type":"object","title":"HTTPValidationError"},"ModeConfig":{"properties":{"mode":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Mode","description":"Force a specific drive mode (or None to auto-cycle)"}},"type":"object","title":"ModeConfig"},"ProtocolConfig":{"properties":{"protocol":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(http|mqtt)$","title":"Protocol"}},"type":"object","required":["protocol"],"title":"ProtocolConfig"},"RecommendationRequest":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id","description":"Vehicle node to analyse"}},"type":"object","required":["device_id"],"title":"RecommendationRequest"},"RegisterRequest":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"title":"Device Id","description":"Unique device identifier (e.g. 'ESP32-001')","examples":["ESP32-001"]}},"type":"object","required":["device_id"],"title":"RegisterRequest"},"RegisterResponse":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id"},"api_key":{"type":"string","title":"Api Key"},"device_secret":{"type":"string","title":"Device Secret"},"registered_at":{"type":"string","title":"Registered At"},"message":{"type":"string","title":"Message"}},"type":"object","required":["device_id","api_key","device_secret","registered_at","message"],"title":"RegisterResponse"},"ReplayConfig":{"properties":{"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled"}},"type":"object","required":["enabled"],"title":"ReplayConfig"},"ValidationError":{"properties":{"loc":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"integer"}]},"type":"array","title":"Location"},"msg":{"type":"string","title":"Message"},"type":{"type":"string","title":"Error Type"}},"type":"object","required":["loc","msg","type"],"title":"ValidationError"},"VehicleAiRequest":{"properties":{"device_id":{"type":"string","title":"Device Id","description":"Vehicle to toggle AI for"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean","title":"Enabled","description":"True = AI on for this vehicle"}},"type":"object","required":["device_id","enabled"],"title":"VehicleAiRequest"}}}}